  "body": "10-Year Stanford Insurance Building Warranty | CCC & Title Issued\r\n\r\nStunning, brand new and thoughtfully designed, this impressive residence combines contemporary style, exceptional comfort and an enviable North Shore location. Bathed in natural sunlight, this spacious two-level home offers generous accommodation and excellent flexibility for modern family living.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Three spacious living areas, providing plenty of room for family relaxation, entertaining and versatile everyday living\r\n\r\n• Five generous double bedrooms and 3.5 beautifully appointed bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Two master suites, thoughtfully positioned across both levels, offering excellent flexibility for extended family, guests or different lifestyle needs\r\n\r\n• Two designer kitchens with quality finishes and excellent functionality, ideal for families who enjoy cooking and entertaining\r\n\r\n• Bright, expansive interiors with excellent natural light and a welcoming sense of space\r\n\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a sunny deck, creating a private setting for entertaining, relaxing and enjoying family time\r\n\r\n• Double internal-access garage providing secure parking and excellent storage\r\n\r\nExceptional North Shore Location\r\nEnjoy excellent connectivity with easy access to bus routes, motorway links and the nearby Park & Ride. Albany, Browns Bay and Long Bay are all within easy reach, offering an excellent selection of shopping, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the proximity to quality local schools, beautiful beaches, parks and playgrounds, making everyday living both convenient and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, thoughtful design and an enviable location, this exceptional home delivers the space, flexibility and modern lifestyle today’s families are looking for.\r\n\r\nBrowns Bay is used as the suburb for search purposes; however, the property is physically located in Northcross.",
